---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import EditorialIcon from '../components/EditorialIcon.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/paths';
const downloads = [
  {icon:'air', title:'We Share the Air poster', text:'University of Toronto EHS PDF poster for workplaces and shared indoor spaces.', href:'https://ehs.utoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2015/10/Scent-Policy-Poster.pdf', label:'Open PDF poster ↗'},
  {icon:'people', title:'Scent-free poster', text:'A second University of Toronto EHS poster layout for sharing a simple fragrance-aware request.', href:'https://ehs.utoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/Scentfree-Poster-20180129.pdf', label:'Open PDF poster ↗'},
  {icon:'label', title:'2.5-inch scent-free decal', text:'University of Toronto EHS printable label concept for a door, meeting room or shared resource.', href:'https://ehs.utoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2018/05/scent-free-label-concept_-mar5_2018.pdf', label:'Open decal template ↗'},
  {icon:'book', title:'Sample communication letter', text:'University of Toronto EHS Word template for sharing scent-free guidelines with a group.', href:'https://ehs.utoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2018/01/Scent-Free-Guidelines-Sample-Communication-20180126.docx', label:'Download Word template ↗'},
];
---
<Layout title="We Share the Air | CleanCare" description="Respectful, practical resources for fragrance-aware shared spaces: posters, decals and sample communication templates.">
  <section class="share-hero"><div class="container share-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">We Share the Air</p><h1>One shared space.<br/><em>More room for everyone.</em></h1><p class="intro">A fragrance-aware request is not about judging someone’s choices. It is a practical way to reduce avoidable scent in a workplace, classroom, healthcare setting, event or home that people share.</p><div class="share-hero-actions"><a class="button" href="#resources">Browse posters &amp; templates</a><a class="text-link" href={url('guides/shared-spaces/')}>Read the shared-spaces guide →</a></div></div><div class="share-illustration" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 380 300"><circle cx="190" cy="145" r="116" fill="#e8f3f8"/><path d="M92 170c30-25 62-25 92 0s62 25 92 0" fill="none" stroke="#72a28f" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M109 131c21-18 44-18 65 0m33-43c21-18 44-18 65 0" fill="none" stroke="#92b3c2" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M132 213v-55c0-14 12-26 26-26h64c14 0 26 12 26 26v55" fill="#fffdf9" stroke="#496d60" stroke-width="6" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M150 178h80m-80 19h56" stroke="#89a59b" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M190 130V88m-16 16 16-16 16 16" fill="none" stroke="#f4a261" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span>Clean air is shared air</span></div></div></section>

  <section id="resources" class="container share-resources"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Ready-to-use resources</p><h2>Print, adapt, share.</h2></div><p>These files belong to their publishers. Open the original source before printing or adapting, and follow its terms of use.</p></div><div class="share-resource-grid">{downloads.map(item => <article><span><EditorialIcon name={item.icon}/></span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p><a class="text-link" href={item.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{item.label}</a></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="container letter-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Simple communication starters</p><h2>Begin with an invitation, not an accusation.</h2><p>Use a tone that is specific, practical and inclusive. Edit the wording for your setting, and avoid presenting a general request as a medical diagnosis of another person.</p></div><div class="letter-list"><details open><summary>Template: a workplace or event request</summary><div><p><strong>Subject:</strong> A fragrance-aware request for our shared space</p><p>Hello [name/team],</p><p>To help make our shared space more comfortable for people who are sensitive to scented products, could we ask attendees to avoid perfume, cologne, air fresheners and strongly fragranced personal-care products for [meeting/event]? This is a simple, voluntary way to reduce avoidable scent in the room.</p><p>Thank you for helping create a more inclusive environment. I can share a short poster or source-led information if useful.</p><p>Best,<br/>[your name]</p></div></details><details><summary>Template: feedback for a business or public space</summary><div><p>Hello [business/organisation],</p><p>I value your space and would like to ask whether you could reduce or remove air fresheners and strongly fragranced products in customer areas. A lower-scent environment can make it easier for people with fragrance sensitivities to visit and work comfortably.</p><p>If scent is being used to cover an odour, addressing the source may be more effective. Thank you for considering this practical accessibility step.</p><p>Kind regards,<br/>[your name]</p></div></details><a class="text-link" href="https://www.naturallynorny.com/letter-templates.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">More community letter templates from Naturally Norny ↗</a></div></section>

  <section class="container share-note"><span><EditorialIcon name="heart"/></span><div><p class="eyebrow">A shared approach</p><h2>Make the request easy to honour.</h2><p>Give advance notice, offer a clear example of what to avoid, and focus on the setting—not on policing people. A poster works best alongside practical policies: fragrance-free cleaning and laundry products, no plug-ins or sprays in common areas, and a way to raise concerns respectfully.</p></div><a class="button" href={url('take-action/')}>Explore Take Action →</a></section>
</Layout>
<style>
 .share-hero{padding:68px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fbf9f6 0%,#e9f4f4 64%,#edf3e6 100%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.share-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:50px;align-items:center}.share-hero h1{margin:10px 0 20px;font-size:clamp(44px,5.8vw,76px);line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.055em}.share-hero h1 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:#587d6c}.share-hero-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-top:24px}.share-illustration{padding:25px;border-radius:42% 42% 18px 18px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 42px #40584d14}.share-illustration svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.share-illustration span{display:block;margin-top:2px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;text-align:center}.share-resources{padding-block:58px}.section-heading>p{max-width:430px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.share-resource-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px}.share-resource-grid article{display:flex;min-height:230px;flex-direction:column;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;background:#fff}.share-resource-grid article>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;margin-bottom:25px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-sky)}.share-resource-grid h3{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.35}.share-resource-grid p{margin:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.share-resource-grid .text-link{margin-top:auto;font-size:12px}.letter-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr;gap:56px;padding:40px;border-radius:24px;background:#fffaf4}.letter-section h2{margin:6px 0 12px;font-size:clamp(30px,3.5vw,46px);line-height:1.1}.letter-section>div>p:not(.eyebrow){margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.8}.letter-list{display:grid;gap:10px}.letter-list details{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:13px;background:#fff;padding:0 17px}.letter-list summary{padding:16px 0;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}.letter-list details div{padding:0 0 16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.letter-list details p{margin:0 0 10px}.letter-list details p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.letter-list>a{margin-top:5px;font-size:13px}.share-note{display:grid;grid-template-columns:48px 1fr auto;gap:20px;align-items:center;margin-block:58px;padding:34px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:24px;background:#fff}.share-note>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:#edf3e6}.share-note h2{margin:6px 0 10px;font-size:30px}.share-note p:last-child{max-width:750px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75}@media(max-width:900px){.share-hero-grid,.letter-section{grid-template-columns:1fr}.share-resource-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.share-illustration{max-width:480px}.share-note{align-items:flex-start;grid-template-columns:48px 1fr}.share-note .button{grid-column:2;justify-self:start}}@media(max-width:560px){.share-hero{padding:44px 0}.share-resource-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.letter-section,.share-note{padding:24px}.share-hero-actions{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.share-note{margin-block:36px;gap:14px}.share-note h2{font-size:27px}}
</style>
